      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Annotation">
        <Text><![CDATA[Here we have the trial number and the reponse code.
Things we want to do with this:

1. Different outcomes depending on response, 
        # Incorrect, then we have a timeout
        # Correct, valve trigger


1. Track performance and visualise in the gui
        Track actual response (0/-1/1) of last 50 trials
        Running performance over 20 responsive trials (True/False)
]]></Text>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:BehaviorSubject">
        <Name>ResponseData</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Annotation">
        <Name>This fires at declaration, so skip</Name>
        <Text><![CDATA[This fires at declaration, so skip]]></Text>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
        <Name>StartSession</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
